00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:17.780
In Russia, tea is the heart of hospitality, guests are almost always offered tea with jam, lemon or sweets.

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:23.500
Refusing it can seem impolite because the samovar keeps water hot for hours, so the tea stays ready.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.720
Hosts refill cups without asking.

